<Base title="Privacy" description="AINN privacy policy.">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p>AINN does not require accounts and does not collect personal information directly.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>We show a small number of ads to cover running costs. Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits. You can opt out of personalised advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on Vercel, which may log standard request data (such as IP address and user agent) for security and operations.</p>
  <p><em>Review and adapt this policy for your jurisdiction (e.g. GDPR/CCPA consent requirements) before enabling ads.</em></p>
</Base>
